  "written_results": [
    "For x>=1, N=floor(x): H_(1/3)(log x)=D_N+C_N-T_N(x), retaining every ordered pair and the entire finite-response tail.",
    "The finite-response tail is 6*x^(-2/3)*(A_N-(4/7)*M_N*x^(-1/2))^2+(108/245)*M_N^2*x^(-5/3). It is not the actual future pickup tail or the Euler-product correction.",
    "0<=D_N<=27/7; uniform C_N-T_N(N)<=C gives uniform H_(1/3)<=C+27/7.",
    "For S_N=(3/2)*sum_(1<=n<N)(A_n-M_n/sqrt(n))^2*(n^(-2/3)-(n+1)^(-2/3)): H_(1/3)(log N)<=8*S_N+3 and S_N<=H_(1/3)(log N)/2+3/4.",
    "The finite weighted Mertens-source identity retains the negative (3/5)*M_N^2*x^(-5/3) cutoff compensation."
